":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic: Why...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Why is it important to donate to charitable organizations, causes, or individuals in need?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n<strong>The post will be sent to three recipients consisting of three Prolific participants. <\/strong>Each recipient will independently have the opportunity to react and reply to your post. You will be notified of those reactions and replies by Prolific message.<br>\n<br>\nThe message sent to the recipient will look as follows:<br>\n<br>\n${q:\/\/QID1216739362\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} (aged ${q:\/\/QID1216739351\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}, ${q:\/\/QID1216739355\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}) from ${q:\/\/QID1216739363\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} wrote the following post<br>\n<img src=\"${q:\/\/QID77\/UploadedFileLink}\"><br><br>[your post here]<br><br>Which of the following emojis would you react with if you saw this post on your social media timeline, if any?\n<br>Like\n<br>Love\n<br>Care\n<br>Haha\n<br>Wow\n<br>Sad\n<br>Angry\n<br>I would not react to this post. \n\n<br><br>If you feel inclined to respond, what would your reply be? Please write your response below as you would post it on social media.\n<br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WritingIdentified3","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic: Why...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"TreatIdentity","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span>  <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatIdentity<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>"},"1":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"TreatComp","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"3","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And<\/span>  <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatComp<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 3 <\/span>","Conjuction":"And"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID115"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID116","SecondaryAttribute":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic: Why...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Why is it important to donate to charitable organizations, causes, or individuals in need?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n<strong>The post will be sent to three recipients consisting of two Prolific participants, and one traditional rule-based bot. <\/strong>Each recipient will independently have the opportunity to react and reply to your post. You will be notified of those reactions and replies by Prolific message.<br>\n<br>\nThe message sent to the recipient will look as follows:<br>\n<br>\n${q:\/\/QID1216739362\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} (aged ${q:\/\/QID1216739351\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}, ${q:\/\/QID1216739355\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}) from ${q:\/\/QID1216739363\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} wrote the following post<br>\n<img src=\"${q:\/\/QID77\/UploadedFileLink}\"><br><br>[your post here]<br><br>Which of the following emojis would you react with if you saw this post on your social media timeline, if any?\n<br>Like\n<br>Love\n<br>Care\n<br>Haha\n<br>Wow\n<br>Sad\n<br>Angry\n<br>I would not react to this post. \n\n<br><br>If you feel inclined to respond, what would your reply be? Please write your response below as you would post it on social media.\n<br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WritingIdentified2","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic: Why...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"TreatIdentity","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span>  <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatIdentity<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>"},"1":{"LogicType":"EmbeddedField","LeftOperand":"TreatComp","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"2","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And<\/span>  <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatComp<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 2 <\/span>","Conjuction":"And"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID116"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID117","SecondaryAttribute":"How many of these three recipients do you think will reply to your message?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How many of these three recipients do you think will reply to your message?<br>","DataExportTag":"InteractionNum","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How many of these three recipients do you think will reply to your message?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"6":{"Display":"2"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","6","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID117","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID118","SecondaryAttribute":"We will now provide you with some information about the study and its purposes. Make sure to clic...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We will now provide you with some information about the study and its purposes.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Make sure to click the next arrow to submit your survey responses. <\/b><br>\n<br>During this study, you completed a writing task. The purpose of the study is to understand human engagement in online communication in the presence of generative AI and rule-based bots. The composition of who will see your responses, as well as whether your name and Instagram handle (if relevant) will be shared, are randomly determined.<br>\n<br>\nIf you have any questions, concerns, or complaints or if you feel you have been harmed by this research, please contact our team at sadane@ethz.ch.<br>\n<br>\nWe would like to remind you that your participation in this research is completely voluntary. It is up to you to decide whether or not to continue participating in this study. If you decide to withdraw from the research at this time, we will destroy any data collected about you during this study. The decision to withdraw from this research will involve no penalty or loss of any benefits to which you are otherwise entitled. This will not affect your relationship with the investigator. If you would like to withdraw from this study, please let the investigator know.<br>\n<br>\nInstitutional Review Board: If you have any questions about your rights as a research subject, including concerns, complaints, or to offer input, you may call the Office for the Protection of Research Subjects (OPRS) at 217-333-2670 or e-mail OPRS at <u>irb@illinois.edu.<\/u> If you would like to complete a brief survey to provide OPRS feedback about your experiences as a research participant, please follow the link <b><a href=\"https:\/\/redcap.healthinstitute.illinois.edu\/surveys\/?s=47X9T4NE4X\">here<\/a><\/b> or through a link on the OPRS website: <a href=\"https:\/\/oprs.research.illinois.edu\/\">https:\/\/oprs.research.illinois.edu\/<\/a>. You will have the option to provide feedback or concerns anonymously or you may provide your name and contact information for follow-up purposes.<br>\n<br>\nThank you again for participating in our study. Your contribution is invaluable and helps advance our understanding of this important topic.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Debrief","QuestionID":"QID118","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We will now provide you with some information about the study and its purposes. Make sure to clic...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID119","SecondaryAttribute":"STUDY OVERVIEW You have been invited to take part in a research study conducted by the Online Res...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>STUDY OVERVIEW <\/b><br>\n<br>\nYou have been invited to take part in a research study conducted by the Online Research Team. The purpose of the study is to understand public opinion in Switzerland. If you agree to be in this study, you will be asked to complete this survey. The survey takes 20 minutes. You will receive CHF10 for your participation. In addition, you will be automatically enrolled in a lottery to win an additional CHF100 (odds of winning is 1 in 999).<br>\n<br>\n<b>STUDY PROCEDURE<\/b><br>\n<br>\nWe will ask you for your opinion on certain issues. Additionally, you will be asked to participate in a writing task. Your response to this task and demographic information may be shared with another randomly chosen participant. If any part of this is unclear, or if you require further information, please do not hesitate to ask us. You are encouraged to take as much time as you need to decide whether to participate in this study.<br>\n<br>\n<b>PRIVACY AND CONFIDENTIALITY<\/b><br>\n<br>\nData security and privacy are important to us. Your session ID is recorded automatically. This information will be stored on secure servers and cannot be accessed by anyone outside the research team.<br>\n<br>\nWe will post the anonymized data from this study in a research data repository so that other researchers can re-produce our results. Before posting the data, we will remove any information that could identify you personally. We will not sell data from the study or share data for any commercial or marketing purposes.<br>\n<br>\nEfforts will be made to limit the use and disclosure of your personal information, including research study records, to people who have a need to review this information. We cannot promise complete secrecy.<br>\n<br>\nThere are reasons why information about you may be used or seen by other people beyond the research team during or after this study. Examples include:\n<ul>\n\t<li>University officials, government officials, study funders, auditors, and the Institutional Review Board may need access to the study information to make sure the study is done in a safe and appropriate manner.<\/li>\n\t<li>Collaborating researchers at other institutions who are involved with this study.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\n<b>FUTURE USE OF DATA<\/b><br>\n<br>\nWe will keep the information we collect about you during this research study for study recordkeeping. Your name and other information that can directly identify you will be stored securely and separately from the rest of the research information we collect from you. The researchers may contact you again as part of this research study. De-identified data from this study may be shared with the research community, with journals in which study results are published, and with databases and data repositories used for research. We will remove or code any personal information that could directly identify you before the study data are shared. Despite these measures, we cannot guarantee the anonymity of your personal data. The results of this study could be shared in articles and presentations but will not include any information that identifies you unless you give permission for use of information that identifies you in articles and presentations.<br>\n<br>\n<b>RISKS AND BENEFITS<\/b><br>\n<br>\nWhile we will take every precaution to maintain the confidentiality of your data, there is a minimal risk of breach due to unforeseen circumstances. In the event of any data breach, we will inform you immediately. You will not receive any direct benefits from participating. We believe that your participation in this study will make a significant contribution to ongoing academic research.<br>\n<br>\n<b>VOLUNTARY PARTICIPATION <\/b><br>\n<br>\nParticipation in this study is completely voluntary. You are free to decline to participate or to end participation at any time for any reason without penalty.<br>\n<br>\n<b>CONTACT INFORMATION <\/b><br>\n<br>\nIf there is anything about the study or your participation that is unclear or that you do not understand, if you have questions or wish to report a research-related problem, you may contact our team at <u>sadane@ethz.ch<\/u>.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Institutional Review Board<\/b>: If you have any questions about your rights as a research subject, including concerns, complaints, or to offer input, you may call the Office for the Protection of Research Subjects (OPRS) at 217-333-2670 or e-mail OPRS at irb@illinois.edu. If you would like to complete a brief survey to provide OPRS feedback about your experiences as a research participant, please follow the link <b><a href=\"https:\/\/redcap.healthinstitute.illinois.edu\/surveys\/?s=47X9T4NE4X\">here<\/a><\/b> or through a link on the OPRS website: <a href=\"https:\/\/oprs.research.illinois.edu\/\">https:\/\/oprs.research.illinois.edu\/<\/a>. You will have the option to provide feedback or concerns anonymously or you may provide your name and contact information for follow-up purposes","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ConsentInfo","QuestionID":"QID119","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"STUDY OVERVIEW You have been invited to take part in a research study conducted by the Online Res...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID120","SecondaryAttribute":"Would you call yourself a strong ${q:\/\/QID1216739368\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices} or a not very s...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Would you call yourself a strong ${q:\/\/QID1216739368\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices} or a not very strong ${q:\/\/QID1216739368\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}?","DataExportTag":"PoliticalDetail","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Would you call yourself a strong ${q:\/\/QID1216739368\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices} or a not very s...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Strong"},"2":{"Display":"Not very strong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID120","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1216739368","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1216739368","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In politics, as of today, do you consider yourself a Republican, a Democrat or an independent?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Democrat<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"1":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1216739368","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/3","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1216739368","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/3","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In politics, as of today, do you consider yourself a Republican, a Democrat or an independent?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Republican<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID121","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you think of yourself as closer to the Republican or Democratic party?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you think of yourself as closer to the Republican or Democratic party?","DataExportTag":"Independent","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you think of yourself as closer to the Republican or Democratic party?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Democrat"},"2":{"Display":"Republican"},"3":{"Display":"Neither"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID121","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In politics, as of today, do you consider yourself a Republican, a Democrat or an independent?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Independent<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1216739368\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1216739368","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1216739368","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739346","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q14","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":28,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","QuestionID":"QID1216739346"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739347","SecondaryAttribute":"Welcome! We have a couple of quick questions before we start. \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Intro","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Welcome! We have a couple of quick questions before we start. \u00a0","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place Your Javascript Below This Line needs to be on a separate page *\/\n\t\n\tparent.postMessage('firePixel',\"*\");\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","QuestionText":"Welcome! We have a couple of quick questions before we start. <br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Welcome! We have a couple of quick questions before we start.","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739347"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739348","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"First","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":20,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","QuestionID":"QID1216739348"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739349","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00a0Do you live in the United States?\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Country","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0Do you live in the United States?\u00a0","QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Do you live in the United States?&nbsp;<\/font><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Do you live in the United States?&nbsp;<\/font><\/p>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739349"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739350","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q17","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":16,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","QuestionID":"QID1216739350"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739351","SecondaryAttribute":"What is your age?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Age","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"What is your age?","QuestionText":"What is your age?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"What is your age?","QuestionType":"TE","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"Selector":"SL","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip","ValidNumber":{"Min":"1","Max":"100","NumDecimals":"0"}}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739351"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739352","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q104","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Validation":"None","GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739352"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739353","SecondaryAttribute":"Congrats! You are qualified to participate! \u00a0 We are a non-partisan group of researchers who stud..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"IntroToStudy","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Congrats! You are qualified to participate! \u00a0 We are a non-partisan group of researchers who stud...","QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\">Congrats! You are qualified to participate!<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We are a<strong> non-partisan group of researchers <\/strong>who study public opinion in Europe and the US.<\/p><br><strong>Participants like you are crucial to the study.&nbsp;<\/strong><br><p dir=\"ltr\"><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">It is essential that you <strong>read each question carefully and answer honestly<\/strong>. You might not agree with all the information presented and that is perfectly fine. Our survey will give you an opportunity to express your views.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This survey takes around 20 minutes (on average) to complete. On the next page, we\u2019ll give you more details about the study.&nbsp;<\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">If you have any other questions or comments, feel free to reach out to our research team directly at sadane@ethz.ch.<br><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Thanks!<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\">Online Research Team<\/p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Congrats! You are qualified to participate!<br>\n<br>\nWe are a <strong>non-partisan group of researchers<\/strong> who study U.S. policies. \n<\/p><p>&nbsp; \n\n<br>\n<strong>Participants like you are crucial to the study.&nbsp;<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIt is essential that you <strong>read the questions very carefully and answer honestly<\/strong>. You might not agree with all the information presented and that is perfectly fine. Our survey will give you an opportunity to express your views.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n\n<\/p>This survey takes around 12 minutes (on average) to complete. \n<p><br><\/p><p>If you have any questions about your rights or responsibilities as a research participant, please contact the Columbia University Human Research Protection Office at: Phone 212-305-5883; Email askirb@columbia.edu. Our protocol number is IRB-AAAU3574.&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>If you have any other questions or comments, feel free to reach out to our research team at ls3952@columbia.edu.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Thanks!&nbsp;<\/p><p>Online Research Team<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739353"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739354","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q22","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":16,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","QuestionID":"QID1216739354"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739355","SecondaryAttribute":"What gender do you most strongly identify with?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,"4"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Male"},"2":{"Display":"Female"},"4":{"Display":"Other\/non-binary"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Gender","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":6,"QuestionDescription":"What gender do you most strongly identify with?","QuestionText":"What gender do you most strongly identify with?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"What gender do you most strongly identify with?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739355"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739356","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q101","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Validation":"None","GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739356"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739357","SecondaryAttribute":"Finally, we will ask you a few more demographic questions. What is your race\/ethnicity?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"American Indian or Alaska Native"},"2":{"Display":"Asian or Pacific Islander"},"3":{"Display":"Black or African American"},"4":{"Display":"Hispanic or Latinx"},"5":{"Display":"White"},"6":{"Display":"Other"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Race","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":7,"QuestionDescription":"Finally, we will ask you a few more demographic questions. What is your race\/ethnicity?","QuestionText":"Finally, we will ask you a few more demographic questions.\r\n<br><br>What is your race\/ethnicity?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"What is your race\/ethnicity?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739357"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739358","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q102","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":