,"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":14,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"12":{"Display":"Neither agree or disagree"},"13":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":-5},"2":{"Display":-4},"3":{"Display":-3},"4":{"Display":-2},"5":{"Display":-1},"6":{"Display":0},"7":{"Display":1},"8":{"Display":2},"9":{"Display":3},"10":{"Display":4},"11":{"Display":5}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"As you may know, the Supreme Court\u2019s decision found that the government is not required to provide the same federal benefits to residents of Puerto Rico and other U.S. territories as residents of the 50 States. <br><br>All in all, <b>do you agree or disagree with this decision<\/b>?<br><br>Please click on the slider to indicate your opinion (with -5 as \"Strongly disagree\", 0 as \"Neither agree or disagree\", and 5 as \"Strongly agree\").\n<br>","QuestionID":"QID1216739377"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739378","SecondaryAttribute":"As you may know, the Supreme Court\u2019s decision found that colleges cannot use race as one of sever.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"As you may know, the Supreme Court\u2019s decision found that colleges cannot use race as one of several factors in deciding which applicants to admit.<br><br>All in all, <b>do you agree or disagree with this decision<\/b>?\n<br><br>Please click on the slider to indicate your opinion (with -5 as \"Strongly disagree\", 0 as \"Neither agree or disagree\", and 5 as \"Strongly agree\").\n<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AgreeAffirmative","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":-5,"CSSliderMax":5,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":true,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"4":0.5},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"As you may know, the Supreme Court\u2019s decision found that colleges cannot use race as one of sever...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":14,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"12":{"Display":"Neither agree or disagree"},"13":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"Answers":{"1":{"Display":-5},"2":{"Display":-4},"3":{"Display":-3},"4":{"Display":-2},"5":{"Display":-1},"6":{"Display":0},"7":{"Display":1},"8":{"Display":2},"9":{"Display":3},"10":{"Display":4},"11":{"Display":5}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"As you may know, the Supreme Court\u2019s decision found that colleges cannot use race as one of several factors in deciding which applicants to admit.<br><br>All in all, <b>do you agree or disagree with this decision<\/b>?\n<br><br>Please click on the slider to indicate your opinion (with -5 as \"Strongly disagree\", 0 as \"Neither agree or disagree\", and 5 as \"Strongly agree\").\n<br>","QuestionID":"QID1216739378"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739379","SecondaryAttribute":"As you may know, our federal government is made up of three branches: an executive branch, headed...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"As you may know, our federal government is made up of three branches: an executive branch, headed by the president; a judicial branch, headed by the U.S. Supreme Court; and a legislative branch, made up of the U.S. Senate and House of Representatives. \r\n<br><br>How much trust and confidence do you have at this time in <b>the judicial branch headed by the U.S. Supreme Court<\/b>?\n\n \n<br><br>Please click on the slider to indicate your opinion (with 0 as \"None at all\", 5 as \"Some\", and 10 as \"A great deal\").<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ConfidenceCourt","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,