preme Court?","QuestionID":"QID1216739388"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739389","SecondaryAttribute":"In order to facilitate our research, we are interested in knowing certain factors about you. Spec...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","16","17"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Single"},"16":{"Display":"Married"},"17":{"Display":"Other"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"AttentionCheck","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":18,"QuestionDescription":"In order to facilitate our research, we are interested in knowing certain factors about you. Spec...","QuestionText":"In order to facilitate our research, we are interested in knowing certain factors about you. Specifically, we are interested in whether you actually take the time to read the directions; if not, then the data we collect based on your responses will be invalid. So, in order to demonstrate that you have read the instructions, please ignore the next question, and simply write &quot;I read the instructions&quot; in the &quot;Any comments?&quot; box below. Thank you very much.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWhat is your marital status?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"In order to facilitate our research, we are interested in knowing certain factors about you. Specifically, we are interested in whether you actually take the time to read the directions; if not, then the data we collect based on your responses will be invalid. So, in order to demonstrate that you have read the instructions, please ignore the next question, and simply write \"I read the instructions\" in the \"Any comments?\" box below. Thank you very much.<br><br>\nWhat is your marital status?\r\n<br>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739389"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739390","SecondaryAttribute":"Any comments?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"AttentionCheckText","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Any comments?","QuestionText":"<div>Any comments?<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>Any comments?<\/div>","QuestionType":"TE","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"Selector":"ML","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID1216739390"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739391","SecondaryAttribute":"In this study, we are interested in your views about two types of \u201cbots\u201d \u2013 that is, automated ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>In this study, we are interested in your views about two types of \u201cbots\u201d \u2013 that is, automated programs designed to perform tasks or engage in conversations with humans.&nbsp;<\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>The first type, known as <strong>'rule-based bots,' <\/strong>operate on a set of predefined rules and responses. They are programmed to recognize specific commands and provide corresponding answers. These bots are often found in customer service chat functions, where they can efficiently handle routine inquiries without human intervention. <strong>Rule-based bots have a specific, limited functionality, and it is easy to distinguish them from humans.<\/strong><\/p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>The second type represents a more advanced form of technology: <strong>'Conversational Generative AI (Gen-AI) bots.'<\/strong> These bots leverage artificial intelligence to perform complex problem-solving tasks and to generate responses that mimic human conversation. Unlike their rule-based counterparts, Gen-AI bots can understand and respond to a wider range of queries with greater nuance, variability, and creativity. They learn from interactions to improve their responses, making them more adaptable and capable of handling deep conversations. As a result, <strong>Gen-AI bots are difficult to distinguish from humans.<\/strong><br><br><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"BotExplain","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this study, we are interested in your views about two types of \u201cbots\u201d \u2013 that is, automated pro...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We now have a few questions about the passage you just read.<br>","QuestionID":"QID1216739391"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739392","SecondaryAttribute":"Which paragraph listed in the Supreme Court Justice viewpoints do you find least persuasive? Plea...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which paragraph listed in the Supreme Court Justice viewpoints do you find least persuasive? Please enter the paragraph number. <br><br>If you find none of the paragraphs persuasive, enter 0.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"TextParagraph","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which paragraph listed in the Supreme Court Justice viewpoints do you find least persuasive? Plea...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","MinChars":"1","TotalChars":"10","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip","ValidNumber":{"Min":"0","Max":"10","NumDecimals":"0"}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowF