ttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["16","21","22","23","24","25"],"Choices":{"16":{"Display":"Demand Justice"},"21":{"Display":"AARP"},"22":{"Display":"Planned Parenthood "},"23":{"Display":"Americans United for Life"},"24":{"Display":"Gun Owners of America "},"25":{"Display":"Brady: United Against Gun Violence"}},"ClarifyingSymbol":"$","ClarifyingSymbolType":"Before","Configuration":{"CSSliderMax":1000,"CSSliderMin":0,"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Donation","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Labels":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":26,"QuestionDescription":"You are automatically enrolled in a lottery to win up to $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney}. Would you be...","QuestionText":"You are automatically enrolled in a lottery to win up to $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney}. Would you be willing to donate to one of the organizations below? If you win, you will be paid $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney} minus the amount of your donation. We will directly pay your desired donation amount to the organization(s) of your choosing, so no further action is required on your part.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nHere is a brief description of what they advocate for:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Demand Justice - advocates for court reform and opposes extreme nominees<\/li>\n\t<li>AARP - advocates for the rights of Puerto Ricans to get access to federal social security benefits<\/li>\n\t<li>Planned Parenthood - advocates for abortion rights Americans<\/li>\n\t<li>United for Life - advocates for government restrictions on abortion care<\/li>\n\t<li>Gun Owners of America - advocates for gun rights<\/li>\n\t<li>Brady: United Against Gun Violence - advocates for gun control and against gun violence<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nEnter how much you&#39;d like to donate to each charity, if any:","QuestionText_Unsafe":"You are automatically enrolled in a lottery to win up to $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney}. Would you be willing to donate to one of the organizations below? If you win, you will be paid $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney} minus the amount of your donation. We will directly pay your desired donation amount to the organization(s) of your choosing, so no further action is required on your part.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nHere is a brief description of what they advocate for:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Demand Justice - advocates for court reform and opposes extreme nominees<\/li>\n\t<li>AARP - advocates for the rights of Puerto Ricans to get access to federal social security benefits<\/li>\n\t<li>Planned Parenthood - advocates for abortion rights Americans<\/li>\n\t<li>United for Life - advocates for government restrictions on abortion care<\/li>\n\t<li>Gun Owners of America - advocates for gun rights<\/li>\n\t<li>Brady: United Against Gun Violence - advocates for gun control and against gun violence<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nEnter how much you&#39;d like to donate to each charity, if any:","QuestionType":"CS","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"ConsistentScaleReversal":false,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"ScaleReversal"},"Selector":"VRTL","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"EnforceRange":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","ChoiceTotal":"${q:\/\/QID56\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID1216739404","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/25","Operator":"LessThanOrEqual","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1216739404","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/25","RightOperand":"$e{ 1000 - q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/24 - q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/23 - q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/22 - q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/21 - q:\/\/QID1216739404\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/16 }","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You are automatically enrolled in a lottery to win up to $