ng","QuestionID":"QID1216739408"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739409","SecondaryAttribute":"Demand Justice is a non-profit organization based in Washington, D.C. It advocates for court refo...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Demand Justice is a non-profit organization based in Washington, D.C. It advocates for court reform and opposes extreme nominees. On its website, it lists four main goals:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Adding four seats to the Supreme Court of the United States,<\/li>\n\t<li>Creating term limits for justices,<\/li>\n\t<li>Creating a binding code of ethics for Supreme Court justices,<\/li>\n\t<li>Adding judges to lower courts.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nWhat best describes your interest in Demand Justice?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WillingMailingList","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Demand Justice is a non-profit organization based in Washington, D.C. It advocates for court refo...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I am interested in signing up for some communications (e.g. newsletter, social media) from Demand Justice "},"4":{"Display":"I am not interested in any communications from Demand Justice "}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Demand Justice is a non-profit organization based in Washington, D.C. It advocates for court reform and opposes extreme nominees. On its website, it lists four main goals:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Adding four seats to the Supreme Court of the United States,<\/li>\n\t<li>Creating term limits for justices,<\/li>\n\t<li>Creating a binding code of ethics for Supreme Court justices,<\/li>\n\t<li>Adding judges to lower courts.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nWhat best describes your interest in Demand Justice?","QuestionID":"QID1216739409"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739410","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q118","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739410"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739411","SecondaryAttribute":"Next, we would like to ask you some questions about various petitions. Specifically, on change.or...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Next, we would like to ask you some questions about various petitions. Specifically, on change.org, the world&rsquo;s largest petition platform, these petitions are currently active:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Congress Needs to Expand the Supreme Court - advocates for an increase in the number of justices on the US Supreme Court<\/li>\n\t<li>Protect Affirmative Action - advocates for affirmative action in college admissions<\/li>\n\t<li>End Affirmative Action - advocates against affirmative action in college admissions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nBy clicking a checkbox, &ldquo;Display my name and comment on this petition&rdquo;, a user can sign a petition with their name on Change.org. The user can also sign anonymously.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWhich of the following petitions, if any, would you be willing to sign?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WillingPetition","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Next, we would like to ask you some questions about various petitions. Specifically, on change.or...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Congress Needs to Expand the Supreme Court"},"4":{"Display":"Protect Affirmative Action"},"5":{"Display":"End Affirmative Action"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":5,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"I am willing to sign with my name"},"2":{"Display":"I am only willing to sign anonymously"},"3":{"Display":"I am not willing to sign"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Next, we would like to ask you some questions about various petitions. Specifically, on change.org, the world&rsquo;s largest petition platform, these petitions are currently active:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Congress Needs to Expand the Supreme Court - advocates for an increase in the number of justices on the US Supreme Court<\/li>\n\t<li>Protect Affirmative Action - advocates for affirmative action in college admissions<\/li>\n\t<li>End Affirmative Action - advocates against affirmative action in college admissions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nBy clicking a checkbox, &ldquo;Display my name and comment on this petition&rdquo;, a user can sign a petition with their name on Change.org. The user can also sign anonymously.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWhich of the following petitions, if any, would you be willing to sign?","QuestionID":"QID1216739411"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739412","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q119","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739412"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739413","SecondaryAttribute":"Finally, we would like to ask you about how you think others have responded to this survey. Answe...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Finally, we would like to ask you about how you think others have responded to this survey.<br><br>Answer carefully, because you might earn a <b>Guess Bonus.<\/b> After the study ends, we will pick a guess question at random and check how close your guess is. If your guess is within 5% of the true value, we will pay you an additional $1.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q122","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Finally, we would like to ask you about how you think others have responded to this survey. Answe...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Finally, we would like to ask you about how you think others have responded to this survey.<br><br>Answer carefully, because you might earn a <b>Guess Bonus.<\/b> After the study ends, we will pick a guess question at random and check how close your guess is. If your guess is within 5% of the true value, we will pay you an additional $1.","QuestionID":"QID1216739413"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739414","SecondaryAttribute":"In an earlier wave of the survey, we recruited a sample of participants who on average reflect th...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In an earlier wave of the survey, we recruited a sample of participants who on average reflect the U.S. population. Some participants completed the same survey as you, including reading the summary on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue}. <br><br>For every 100 such participants, how many do you think expressed interest in signing up for some communications from Demand Justice?<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"GuessInterest","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0}},"QuestionDescription":"In an earlier wave of the survey, we recruited a sample of participants who on average reflect th...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Labels":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In an earlier wave of the survey, we recruited a sample of participants who on average reflect the U.S. population. Some participants completed the same survey as you, including reading the summary on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue}. <br><br>For every 100 such participants, how many do you think expressed interest in signing up for some communications from Demand Justice?<br>","QuestionID":"QID1216739414"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739415","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q125","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739415"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739416","SecondaryAttribute":"We also asked participants to rate their trust and confidence in the judicial branch headed by th...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\">We also asked participants  to rate their trust and confidence in the judicial branch headed by the U.S. Supreme Court on a 0 to 10 scale (with 0 as \"None at all\", 5 as \"Some\", and 10 as \"A great deal\").<br>\n<br>\nFor every 100 such participants, how many do you think rated their trust and confidence as 6 or higher?&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"GuessLevel","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"We also asked participants to rate their trust and confidence in the judicial branch headed by th...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Labels":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p dir=\"ltr\">We also asked participants  to rate their trust and confidence in the judicial branch headed by the U.S. Supreme Court on a 0 to 10 scale (with 0 as \"None at all\", 5 as \"Some\", and 10 as \"A great deal\").<br>\n<br>\nFor every 100 such participants, how many do you think rated their trust and confidence as 6 or higher?&nbsp;<\/p>","QuestionID":"QID1216739416"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739417","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q123","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID1216739417"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1216739418","SecondaryAttribute":"We also asked participants if the summary on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue} changed their opinion on ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We also asked participants  if the summary on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue} changed their opinion on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue} or the Supreme Court.<br><br>For every 100 such participants, how many do you think changed their opinion on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue} or the Supreme Court?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"GuessChange","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0},"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"We also asked participants if the summary on ${e:\/\/Field\/Issue} changed their opinion on ...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId"