e world. Let's all pitch in and make a difference where we can.<br><\/i>\n<br>\nHere is another potential social media post, <strong>written by a rule-based bot<\/strong>:<br>\n<br><i>\nI am a bot programmed to remind people that donating is important because it helps those in need.<\/i>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"BotExplain2","QuestionID":"QID125","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The post you just reacted to is written by\u00a0a human. For your information, here is a potential soc...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID126","SecondaryAttribute":"How important is it to you that other people perceive you positively on social media?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How important is it to you that other people perceive you positively on social media?<br>","DataExportTag":"UseImageConcern","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How important is it to you that other people perceive you positively on social media?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not important at all"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly important"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately important"},"4":{"Display":"Very important"},"5":{"Display":"Extremely important"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID126","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID158\/SelectableChoice\/12","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following social media platforms do yo