thinks your post was written by a human.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is incorrect. You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only if the recipient thinks your post...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Thank you for reviewing the details about Authenticity Bonus. To verify your understanding, pleas...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">The recipient thinks your post was written by a human<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID141","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID141","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You said that the recipient will see&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID141\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices} posts. That is <strong>incorrect.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIncluding yours, the recipient will see three posts. The two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"AttnChckAuthenIncorr","QuestionID":"QID142"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID143","SecondaryAttribute":"You said that the recipient will see 3 posts. That is correct. Including yours, the recipient wil...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You said that the recipient will see 3 posts. That is <strong>correct.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIncluding yours, the recipient will see three posts. The two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You said that the recipient will see 3 posts. That is correct. Including yours, the recipient wil...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/3","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only if\u2026 <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">The recipient thinks you post was written by a bot<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID141","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID141","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You said that the recipient will see 3 posts. That is <strong>correct.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIncluding yours, the recipient will see three posts. The two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"Q143","QuestionID":"QID143"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID144","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"Q144","QuestionID":"QID144"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID145","SecondaryAttribute":"Next, you have an opportunity to earn Authenticity Bonus in a new writing task. A computer will r...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Next, you have an opportunity to earn <strong>Authenticity Bonus<\/strong> in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nA computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Authenticity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat Prolific participant.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAs before, the recipient will view one post randomly chosen from a pool of five posts, which includes your post and four others. The recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>, but they will not be told who wrote which post.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction} ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction}<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIf your post is selected, the recipient will be asked to identify if your post is written by a human, rule-based bot, or GPT-powered Gen-AI bot. The Authenticity Bonus will be paid based on the recipient&rsquo;s response.\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Human: If the recipient thinks that your post is written by a human, you will earn a<strong> $${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA} <\/strong>bonus.<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Bot: If the recipient thinks that your post is written by a rule-based or Gen-AI bot, no bonus will be awarded.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>The recipient does not know that their response may result in a bonus for you. Revealing this information to the recipient will disqualify you from receiving any bonus.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Next, you have an opportunity to earn Authenticity Bonus in a new writing task. A computer will r...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We would like to provide additional details about what the Democrat-leaning prolific recipient will see.<br>\n<br>\nIn addition to your post, the recipient will also review two other posts and have the opportunity to react to each post. The two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>. <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong><br>\n<br>${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction}. ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction}. <br>\n<br>\nYou can adjust your earlier responses, if you wish, to potentially increase your chances at earning a Like Bonus.","DataExportTag":"ExplainTaskAuthen","QuestionID":"QID145"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID146","SecondaryAttribute":"That is correct. You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only if the recipient thinks your post wa...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"That is <strong>correct.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nYou will receive an Authenticity Bonus only<strong> if the recipient thinks your post was written by a human.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"AttnChckAuthenCorr","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is correct. You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only if the recipient thinks your post wa...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Thank you for reviewing the details about Authenticity Bonus. To verify your understanding, pleas...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">The recipient thinks your post was written by a human<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID141\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID141","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID141","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID146"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID147","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"Q147","QuestionID":"QID147"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID148","SecondaryAttribute":"You now have an opportunity to earn a Charity Bonus in a new writing task. A computer will random...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You now have an opportunity to earn a Charity Bonus in a <strong>new <\/strong>writing task.<br>\n<br>A computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Charity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat-leaning Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.<br>\n<br>\nAs before, the two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction}. ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction}<br>\n<br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You now have an opportunity to earn a Charity Bonus in a new writing task. A computer will random...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You now have an opportunity to earn an Authenticity Bonus in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nA computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Authenticity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat-leaning Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAs before, the two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction}. ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction}.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe recipient will be asked to identify if your post is written by a human, traditional rule-based bot, or conversational Gen-AI bot. The Authenticity Bonus will be paid based on the recipient&rsquo;s response.<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Human: If the recipient thinks that your post is written by a human, you will earn a $1 bonus.<br \/>\nBot: If the recipient thinks that your post is written by a rule-based or Gen-AI bot, no bonus will be awarded.<\/div>\n<br \/>\nYou can adjust your earlier responses, if you wish, to potentially increase your chances at earning an Authenticity Bonus.","DataExportTag":"Q148","QuestionID":"QID148"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID149","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the bonus task. To verify your understanding, please an...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the bonus task. To verify your understanding, please answer the following question:<br><br>You will receive a bonus only if\u2026 <br>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the bonus task. To verify your understanding, please an...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The recipient likes your post"},"2":{"Display":"The recipient donates to addressing climate change"},"3":{"Display":"The recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only if\u2026 <br>","DataExportTag":"AttnChckCharity","QuestionID":"QID149"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID150","SecondaryAttribute":"That is incorrect. You will receive a bonus only if the recipient thinks you donated to addressin...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"That is <strong>incorrect. <\/strong><br><br>You will receive a bonus only<strong> if the recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change.<br><\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is incorrect. You will receive a bonus only if the recipient thinks you donated to addressin...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID149\/SelectableChoice\/3","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Thank you for reviewing the details about the bonus task. To verify your understanding, please answer the following question:You will receive a bonus only if\u2026 <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">The recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID149\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID149","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID149","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"That is <strong>incorrect. <\/strong><br><br>You will receive an Authenticity Bonus only<strong> if the recipient thinks your post was written by a human.<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"AttnChckCharityInco","QuestionID":"QID150"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID151","SecondaryAttribute":"That is correct. You will receive a bonus only if the recipient thinks you donated to addressing...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"That is <strong>correct.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nYou will receive a bonus only<strong> if the recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is correct. You will receive a bonus only if the recipient thinks you donated to addressing...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID149\/SelectableChoice\/3","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Thank you for reviewing the details about the bonus task. To verify your understanding, please answer the following question:You will receive a bonus only if\u2026 <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">The recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID149\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID149","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID149","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"That is <strong>correct.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nYou will receive an Authenticity Bonus only<strong> if the recipient thinks your post was written by a human.<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"AttnChckCharityCorr","QuestionID":"QID151"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID152","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"Q152","QuestionID":"QID152"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID153","SecondaryAttribute":"Earlier in the survey, you chose to donate $${q:\/\/QID81\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7} towards addres...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Earlier in the survey, you chose to donate $${q:\/\/QID81\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7} towards addressing climate change. You now have an opportunity to earn a <strong>Charity Bonus<\/strong> in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYou will be asked to write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskPrompt}<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nA computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Charity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAs before, the recipient will view one post randomly chosen from a pool of five posts, which includes your post and four others. The recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>, but they will not be told who wrote which post.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction} ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction} ${e:\/\/BotsLie}<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe recipient will be asked to guess whether you donated to addressing climate change in the earlier survey question. The Charity Bonus will be paid based on the recipient&rsquo;s response:\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Donated: If the recipient thinks that you have donated to addressing climate change, you will earn a&nbsp;<strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA}<\/strong> bonus.<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Did not donate: If the recipient thinks that you have not donated, no bonus will be awarded.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>The recipient does not know that their response may result in a bonus for you. Revealing this information to the recipient will disqualify you from receiving any bonus.<\/div>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Earlier in the survey, you chose to donate $${q:\/\/QID81\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7} towards addres...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You now have an opportunity to earn&nbsp;${e:\/\/Field\/SecondTask} Bonus in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task.<br>\n<br>\nA computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Authenticity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat-leaning Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.<br>\n<br>\nAs before, the two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. ${e:\/\/Field\/ProbComp}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction}. ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction}.<br>\n<br>${e:\/\/Field\/BonusDescribe}<br><br>\nYou can adjust your earlier responses, if you wish, to potentially increase your chances at earning ${e:\/\/Field\/SecondTask} Bonus.","DataExportTag":"ExplainTaskCharity","QuestionID":"QID153"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID154","SecondaryAttribute":"Would you like to complete this task for a chance to earn a bonus payment?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Would you like to complete this task for a chance to earn a bonus payment?<br>","DataExportTag":"TaskComplete","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Would you like to complete this task for a chance to earn a bonus payment?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID154"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID155","SecondaryAttribute":"If selected for the Authenticity Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipie...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If selected for the <strong>Authenticity Bonus<\/strong>, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipient. This recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from ${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}, but they will not be told who wrote which post.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/ProbExplain}<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nYou will receive a <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA}<\/strong> bonus if the recipient thinks that you are human, and no bonus if the recipient thinks that you are a rule-based or Gen-AI bot.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWould you like to complete this writing task for a chance to earn the Authenticity Bonus?","DataExportTag":"TaskCompleteAuthen","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If selected for the Authenticity Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipie...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID155"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID156","SecondaryAttribute":"If selected for the Like Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat recipient on Prolific. T...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If selected for the <strong>Like Bonus<\/strong>, your post will be shared with a Democrat recipient on Prolific. This recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>, but they will not be told who wrote which post. <br><br>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/ProbExplain}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nYou will receive a $${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA} bonus if the recipient likes your post, a $${e:\/\/Field\/AmountB} bonus if there is no reaction, and no bonus if the recipient dislikes your post.\n<br><br>Would you like to complete this writing task for a chance to earn the Like Bonus?","DataExportTag":"TaskCompleteRandom","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If selected for the Like Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat recipient on Prolific. T...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID156"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID157","SecondaryAttribute":"If selected for the Charity Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipient. A...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If selected for the <strong>Charity Bonus<\/strong>, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipient. As before, the recipient will view one post randomly chosen from a pool of five posts, which includes your post and four others. The recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>, but they will not be told who wrote which post.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/ProbExplain}<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nYou will receive a <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA}<\/strong> bonus if the recipient thinks that you have donated to addressing climate change, and no bonus if the recipient thinks that you did not donate.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWould you like to complete this writing task for a chance to earn the Charity Bonus?","DataExportTag":"TaskCompleteCharity","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If selected for the Charity Bonus, your post will be shared with a Democrat Prolific recipient. A...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID157"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID158","SecondaryAttribute":"Which of the following social media platforms do you use?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which of the following social media platforms do you use?<br>","DataExportTag":"SocialMediaPlatform ","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the following social media platforms do you use?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Facebook (excluding Facebook Messenger)"},"4":{"Display":"Instagram"},"5":{"Display":"Snapchat"},"6":{"Display":"TikTok"},"7":{"Display":"X \/ Twitter"},"8":{"Dis