kInstruct}<br><br>Write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br>\n<br>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskPrompt}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nPlease complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or engaging in other activities until you finish.<br><br><br>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n    \/*popupCounter is a variable that keeps track of the number of times*\/ \n    \/*the subject leaves the page*\/\n    var popupCounter = 0;\n    \/*totalTimeOffPage is a variable that keeps track of the total number of *\/ \n    \/*milliseconds the subject spends away from the page*\/ \n    var totalTimeOffPage = 0;\n\n    \/*window.onblur is triggered whenever the subject leaves the page, but *\/\n    \/*IS ONLY triggered TRIGGERED AFTER THE SUBJECT INTERACTS WITH THE PAGE *\/\n    \/*AT LEAST ONCE*\/ \n    window.onblur = function() {\n        \/*this start variable captures the current system time on the*\/ \n        \/*subject's machine*\/ \n        var start = new Date(); \n        \/*if the subject has not yet received a popup, then a popup is *\/\n        \/*triggered warning the subject not to leave the page*\/ \n        if (popupCounter < 1) {     \n        \/*You can set whatever alert message you want inside the parentheses*\/\n        \/*below*\/ \n            alert(\"Please don't leave this until it is complete!\"); \n        }\n        \/*the popupCounter is incremented each time the participant leaves*\/\n        \/*the page*\/ \n        popupCounter ++;  \n        \/*each time the popupCounter is incremented, the Embedded Data value*\/ \n        \/*\"numLeaves\" is updated with the new total number of leaves*\/ \n        Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('numLeavesDonate', popupCounter);\n\n        \/*when the subject returns to the page, the window.onfocus function is*\/\n        \/*triggered*\/ \n        window.onfocus = function() {\n            \/*the end variable captures the current system time on the *\/\n            \/*subject's machine*\/ \n            var end = new Date(); \n            \/*blipTime calculates the total number of MILLISECONDS that*\/\n            \/*passed between the most recent onblur event, and subsequent*\/\n            \/*onfocus event*\/ \n            blipTime = end - start;\n            \/*blipTime is added to the running total time off page in*\/\n            \/*the variable totalTimeOffPage*\/\n            totalTimeOffPage = totalTimeOffPage + blipTime; \n            \/*the Embedded Data value totalTimeOff is updated to reflect*\/\n            \/*the current running total of time off the page*\/ \n            Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('totalTimeOffDonate', totalTimeOffPage);\n        }\n    }\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ESTB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"${e:\/\/Field\/AdjustInstruct} ${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskInstruct} Write a post, similar to what you wo...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None","MinChars":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"${e:\/\/Field\/AdjustInstruct}<br><br>\n${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskInstruct}<br><br>Write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br>\n<br>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskPrompt}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nPlease complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or engaging in other activities until you finish.<br><br><br>","DataExportTag":"WritingTaskDonate","QuestionID":"QID160"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID161","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"Q161","QuestionID":"QID161"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID162","SecondaryAttribute":"You now have an opportunity to earn a Persuasion Bonus in a new writing task \u00a0 You will be asked...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>You now have an opportunity to earn a <strong>Persuasion Bonus<\/strong> in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You will be asked to write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong>${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskPrompt}<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>A computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Persuasion Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>As before, the recipient will view one post randomly chosen from a pool of five posts, which includes your post and four others. The recipient will be informed that the post is randomly chosen from a pool of five posts from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}<\/strong>, but they will not be told who wrote which post.<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction} ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction} ${e:\/\/BotsLie}<br \/>\n<br \/>\nEarlier in the survey, you were asked how much you&rsquo;d like to donate to charitable causes if you win the $${e:\/\/Field\/LotteryMoney} lottery. The recipient will be asked to answer the same question after reading your post. The Persuasion Bonus will be paid based on the recipient&rsquo;s response:<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Persuaded: If the recipient donates to addressing climate change, you will earn a <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA}<\/strong> bonus.<\/li>\n\t<li>Not persuaded: If the recipient does not donate to addressing climate change, no bonus will be awarded.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>Based on past surveys, 60% of Democrat Prolific participants chose to donate to addressing climate change without seeing any posts.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe recipient does not know that their response may result in a bonus for you. Revealing this information to the recipient will disqualify you from receiving any bonus.<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n<\/ul>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tjQuery(\"#\"+this.questionId+\" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\",function(e) {\n   e.preventDefault();\n  });\n\t\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You now have an opportunity to earn a Persuasion Bonus in a new writing task \u00a0 You will be asked...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Earlier in the survey, you chose to donate $${q:\/\/QID81\/ChoiceNumericEntryValue\/7} towards addressing climate change. You now have an opportunity to earn a <strong>Charity Bonus<\/strong> in a <strong>new<\/strong> writing task.<br>\n<br>\nYou will be asked to write a post, similar to what you would write on social media, on the following topic:<br>\n<br>\n<strong>${e:\/\/Field\/WritingTaskPrompt}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nA computer will randomly select a fraction of participants to be eligible for the Charity Bonus. If selected, your post will be shared with another recipient, who is a Democrat Prolific participant. This recipient will also review two other posts.<br>\n<br>\nAs before, the two other posts are from <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/TreatCompLong}. <\/strong>The recipient will be informed that ${e:\/\/Field\/TreatHuman} out of the 3 posts are written by a human, but will not be told the specific source for each individual post.<br>\n<br>\n${e:\/\/Field\/GenAIAction} ${e:\/\/Field\/BotAction} ${e:\/\/BotsLie}<br>\n<br>\nThe recipient will be asked to guess whether you donated to addressing climate change in the earlier survey question. The Charity Bonus will be paid based on the recipient\u2019s response:\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Donated: If the recipient thinks that you have donated to addressing climate change, you will earn a&nbsp;$${e:\/\/Field\/AmountA} bonus.<\/li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Did not donate: If the recipient thinks that you have not donated, no bonus will be awarded.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","DataExportTag":"ExplainTaskPersuade","QuestionID":"QID162"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID163","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the Persuasion Bonus. To verify your understanding, ple...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the Persuasion Bonus. To verify your understanding, please answer the following question:<br><br>You will receive a Persuasion Bonus only if\u2026 <br>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the Persuasion Bonus. To verify your understanding, ple...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The recipient likes your post"},"2":{"Display":"The recipient donates to addressing climate change"},"3":{"Display":"The recipient thinks you donated to addressing climate change"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Thank you for reviewing the details about the Charity Bonus. To verify your understanding, please answer the following question:<br><br>You will receive a Charity Bonus only if\u2026 <br>","DataExportTag":"AttnChckPersuade","QuestionID":"QID163"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID164","SecondaryAttribute":"That is incorrect. You will receive a Persuasion Bonus only if the recipient donates to addressin...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"That is <strong>incorrect. <\/strong><br><br>You will receive a Persuasion Bonus only<strong> if the recipient donates to addressing climate change.<br><\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"That is incorrect. You will receive a Persuasion Bonus only if the recipient donates to addressin...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID163\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\