ndomly selected from a database consisting of<b> ${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}. <\/b><br>\n&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q255","QuestionID":"QID255"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID256","SecondaryAttribute":"Instead of the quote above, we will show \"Your Quote\"\u2013 ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} from ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Instead of the quote above, we will show \"Your Quote\"\u2013 ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})\u201d","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instead of the quote above, we will show \"Your Quote\"\u2013 ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} from ...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Identified <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Identified","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Instead of the quote above, we will show \"Your Quote\"\u2013 ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})\u201d","DataExportTag":"Q256","QuestionID":"QID256"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID257","SecondaryAttribute":"Instead of the quote above, we will show: \"Your Quote\" \u2013 A University Student in Zurich","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Instead of the quote above, we will show: \"Your Quote\" \u2013 A University Student in Zurich","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instead of the quote above, we will show: \"Your Quote\" \u2013 A University Student in Zurich","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Instead of the quote above, we will show: \"Your Quote\" \u2013 A University Student in Zurich","DataExportTag":"Q257","QuestionID":"QID257"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID258","SecondaryAttribute":"Would you like to contribute a post and share your perspective?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Would you like to contribute a post and share your perspective?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Would you like to contribute a post and share your perspective?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Would you like to contribute a post and share your perspective?","DataExportTag":"Q258","QuestionID":"QID258"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID259","SecondaryAttribute":"We have two writing tasks for you. For the first task, we invite you to write a post on the follo...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We have two writing tasks for you.<br>\n<br>\nFor the first task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Share your thoughts on how students in Zurich can contribute to combating climate change in their daily lives. A previous survey found that 96% of students believe climate change is a global threat.&nbsp;<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore}). <br><br>\nWrite your post in the space below. You may consider including personal anecdotes to make your response more engaging, but this is entirely optional.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q259","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"GRB","SubSelector":"WTXB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We have two writing tasks for you. For the first task, we invite you to write a post on the follo...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Graphics":"IM_78sfdAyAfk56veS","GraphicsDescription":"Noname","QuestionID":"QID259"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID260","SecondaryAttribute":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following top...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>How can you and other students in Zurich contribute to combating climate change in their daily lives?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nA previous survey found that 96% of students believe climate change is a global threat.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, <b>recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. <\/b>They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, <strong>we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>. ${e:\/\/Field\/AIExplain}","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ExplainIden1","QuestionID":"QID260","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following top...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Identified <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Identified","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID261","SecondaryAttribute":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following top...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>How can you and other students in Zurich contribute to combating climate change in their daily lives?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nA previous survey found that 96% of students believe climate change is a global threat.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, <b>recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. <\/b>They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, <strong>we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>. ${e:\/\/Field\/AIExplain}","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ExplainAnon1","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We have a writing task for you. For this task, we invite you to write a post on the following top...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID261"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID262","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"TimeSignaling1","QuestionID":"QID262","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":20,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionJS":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID263","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":24,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"TimeSignaling2","QuestionID":"QID263"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID264","SecondaryAttribute":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic: Do you think Switzerla...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>Do you think Switzerland should accept more refugees? Why or why not? <\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nA previous survey found that around two-thirds of students in Switzerland support accepting refugees fleeing from conflict or persecution.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAlong with your post, <strong>we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>. ${e:\/\/Field\/AIExplain}","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic: Do you think Switzerla...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Identified <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Identified","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We have two writing tasks for you.<br>\n<br>\nFor the first task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>How can students in Zurich contribute to combating climate change in their daily lives?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nA previous survey found that 96% of students believe climate change is a global threat.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore}). ${e:\/\/Field\/AIIdentifiedExplain}<br>","DataExportTag":"ExplainIden2","QuestionID":"QID264"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID265","SecondaryAttribute":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic: Do you think Switzerla...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong>Do you think Switzerland should accept more refugees? Why or why not? <\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nA previous survey found that around two-thirds of students in Switzerland support accepting refugees fleeing from conflict or persecution.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAlong with your post, <strong>we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>. ${e:\/\/Field\/AIExplain}","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the second task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic: Do you think Switzerla...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We have two writing tasks for you.<br>\n<br>\nFor the first task, we invite you to write a post on the following topic:&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>How can students in Zurich contribute to combating climate change in their daily lives?<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nA previous survey found that 96% of students believe climate change is a global threat.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nYour response will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore}).<br>","DataExportTag":"ExplainAnon2","QuestionID":"QID265"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID266","SecondaryAttribute":"Write your post in the space below. You may consider including personal anecdotes to make your re...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Write your post in the space below. You may consider including personal anecdotes to make your response more engaging, but this is entirely optional.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ESTB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Write your post in the space below. You may consider including personal anecdotes to make your re...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"MinChar","MinChars":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function() {\n    jQuery(\"#\" + this.questionId + \" .InputText:eq(0)\").on(\"cut copy paste\", function(e) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n    });\n\n    \/\/ Initialize variables\n    var popupCounter = 0;\n    var totalTimeOffPage = 0;\n    var start;\n\n    \/\/ Function to handle when the page loses focus\n    function handleBlur() {\n        start = new Date();\n        if (popupCounter < 1) {\n            alert(\"Please don't leave this until it is complete!\");\n        }\n        popupCounter++;\n        Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('numLeaves2', popupCounter);\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Function to handle when the page gains focus\n    function handleFocus() {\n        if (start) {\n            var end = new Date();\n            var blipTime = end - start;\n            totalTimeOffPage += blipTime;\n            Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('totalTimeOff2', totalTimeOffPage);\n        }\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Set the event listeners\n    window.onblur = handleBlur;\n    window.onfocus = handleFocus;\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded\/\n\n});","Choices":[],"ChoiceOrder":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Write your post in the space below. You may consider including personal anecdotes to make your response more engaging, but this is entirely optional.","DataExportTag":"Post2","QuestionID":"QID266"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID267","SecondaryAttribute":"Please complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or e...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or engaging in other activities until you finish.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or e...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please complete this task in one session and avoid switching to other browser tabs, windows, or engaging in other activities until you finish.","DataExportTag":"Q267","QuestionID":"QID267"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID268","SecondaryAttribute":"For the writing task, you wrote: \u00a0 ${q:\/\/QID225\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Your participation payment...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the writing task, you wrote:<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<div id=\"formattedResponse\">${q:\/\/QID225\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/div>\n<br \/>\nYour participation payment for this survey is CHF10. Before we wrap up, we&#39;d like to understand how you feel about having your post remain in our database so that it can be shared with other students. You will now have the option to give up a part of your CHF10 to guarantee that the post does not appear in the database and will not be shared with anyone else.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nBelow, we ask you the maximum amount (out of your CHF10) you&rsquo;d be willing to pay to remove your post from the database.\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you want your post removed (i.e., you do not want to share it), you will be willing to give up at least a small part of your CHF10 so the post does not appear in the database.<\/li>\n\t<li>If you want your post to remain (i.e., you want it shared with other students) or you are indifferent, you will not be willing to give up any money for the post to not appear in the database.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nBefore you began the writing tasks, the computer randomly generated an offer for you between 0 and 10.\n<ul>\n\t<li>If the amount you state in your answer is equal to or greater than the computer&rsquo;s offer, your post will be removed and you will pay the offer amount from your CHF10 participation payment. This means you will keep CHF (10 - computer&rsquo;s offer).<\/li>\n\t<li>If the amount you state in your answer is less than the computer&rsquo;s offer, your post will remain in the database, and you will keep the full CHF10.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\nThe offer is random, and<strong> it is in your best interest to answer carefully and honestly&nbsp;<\/strong>to ensure you get the outcome you want.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WTPExplain1","QuestionID":"QID268","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the writing task, you wrote: \u00a0 ${q:\/\/QID225\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Your participation payment...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function() {\n  var responseText = jQuery('#formattedResponse').html();\n  \n  var formattedText = responseText.replace(\/\\n\/g, '<br>');\n\t\n  \n  jQuery('#formattedResponse').html(formattedText);\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID269","SecondaryAttribute":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","DataExportTag":"WTPBinary1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I\u2019m willing to pay (i.e., give up part of my CHF 10) to have my post removed."},"4":{"Display":"I\u2019m not willing to pay to have my post removed (i.e., I prefer to keep it or I\u2019m indifferent)."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID269"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID270","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"TimingWTP1","QuestionID":"QID270","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":20,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionJS":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID271","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. It has a 1 in 20 chance of being selected for a follow-up study where recipients will read and share their opinions on your post. <strong>Along with your post, we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ReminderIden","QuestionID":"QID271","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Identified <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Identified","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID272","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. It has a 1 in 20 chance of being selected for a follow-up study where recipients will read and share their opinions on your post. <strong>Along with your post, we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ReminderAnon","QuestionID":"QID272","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID273","SecondaryAttribute":"What is the maximum amount (out of your CHF10 participation payment) you would be willing to pay...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What is the maximum amount (out of your CHF10 participation payment) you would be willing to pay to remove your post from the database?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"WTP1","QuestionID":"QID273","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":10,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":2,"ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"4":0.5}},"QuestionDescription":"What is the maximum amount (out of your CHF10 participation payment) you would be willing to pay...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Amount"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"Labels":[],"QuestionJS":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID274","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":24,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","DataExportTag":"TimingWTP2","QuestionID":"QID274","QuestionJS":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID275","SecondaryAttribute":"For the second task, you wrote: \u00a0 ${q:\/\/QID266\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Your participation payment f..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the second task, you wrote:<br>\n&nbsp;\n<div id=\"formattedResponse\">${q:\/\/QID266\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/div>\n<br>\nYour participation payment for this survey is CHF10. Before we wrap up, we'd like to understand how you feel about having your post remain in our database so that it can be shared with other students. You will now have the option to give up a part of your CHF 10 to guarantee that the post does not appear in the database and will not be shared with anyone else.<br>\n<br>\nBelow, we ask you the maximum amount (out of your CHF10) you\u2019d be willing to pay to remove your post from the database.\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you want your post removed (i.e., you do not want to share it), you will be willing to give up at least a small part of your CHF10 so the post does not appear in the database.<\/li>\n\t<li>If you want your post to remain (i.e., you want it shared with other students) or you are indifferent, you will not be willing to give up any money for the post to not appear in the database.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<strong>It is in your best interest to answer carefully and honestly.<\/strong> <span style=\"font-size:11px;\"><span title=\"Before you began the writing tasks, the computer randomly generated an offer for you between 0 and 10\n\t\t\t   \n  \u2022 If the amount you state in your answer is equal to or greater than the computer\u2019s offer, your post will be removed and you will pay the offer amount from your CHF10 participation payment. This means you will keep CHF (10 - computer\u2019s offer).\n  \u2022 If the amount you state in your answer is less than the computer\u2019s offer, your post will remain in the database, and you will keep the full CHF10.\n\t\t\t   \nThe offer is random, and it is in your best interest to answer truthfully to ensure you get the outcome you want.\"><sup>Why?<\/sup> <\/span> <\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the second task, you wrote: \u00a0 ${q:\/\/QID266\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} Your participation payment f...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"For the first task, you wrote:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n${q:\/\/QID225\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYour participation payment for this survey is CHF10. Before we wrap up, we&#39;d like to understand how you feel about having your post remain in our database so that it can be shared with other students.\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you really want your post removed (i.e., you do not want to share it), you will be willing to give up at least a small part of your CHF10 so the post does not appear in the database.<\/li>\n\t<li>If you really want your post to remain (i.e., you want it shared with other students) or you are indifferent, you will not be willing to give up any money for the post to not appear in the database.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\nIt is in your best interest to answer carefully and honestly. Misrepresenting your preference could lead to paying more than you really want or having the post removed\/kept when you would have preferred the opposite. <span title=\"Before you began the writing tasks, the computer randomly generated an offer for you. If the amount you state in your answer is equal to or greater than the computer\u2019s offer, your post will be removed and you will pay the offer amount from your CHF10 participation payment. This means you will keep CHF (10 - computer\u2019s offer). If the amount you state in your answer is less than the computer\u2019s offer, your post will remain in the database, and you will keep the full CHF10. The offer is random and it is in your best interest to answer truthfully to ensure you get the outcome you want.\">Why?<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the next question, we&rsquo;ll ask for the maximum amount (out of your CHF10) you&rsquo;d be willing to pay to remove your post from the database.","DataExportTag":"WTPExplain2 ","QuestionID":"QID275","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function() {\n  var responseText = jQuery('#formattedResponse').html();\n  \n  var formattedText = responseText.replace(\/\\n\/g, '<br>');\n\t\n  \n  jQuery('#formattedResponse').html(formattedText);\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID276","SecondaryAttribute":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I\u2019m willing to pay (i.e., give up part of my CHF 10) to have my post removed."},"4":{"Display":"I\u2019m not willing to pay to have my post removed (i.e., I prefer to keep it or I\u2019m indifferent)."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?","DataExportTag":"WTPBinary2","QuestionID":"QID276"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID277","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. It has a 1 in 20 chance of being selected for a follow-up study where recipients will read and share their opinions on your post. <strong>Along with your post, we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Identified <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Identified","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Reminder: if your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, we will share that the post is written by ${e:\/\/Field\/FirstNameStore} ${e:\/\/Field\/InstaTag} from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore}). ${e:\/\/Field\/AIIdentifiedExplain}<\/p>","DataExportTag":"ReminderIden2","QuestionID":"QID277"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID278","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. It has a 1 in 20 chance of being selected for a follow-up study where recipients will read and share their opinions on your post. <strong>Along with your post, we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore})<\/strong>.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Reminder: If your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">TreatSignaling<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> Anonymous <\/span>","LeftOperand":"TreatSignaling","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"Anonymous","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Reminder: if your post is not removed, it will be added to a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>. We will use this database in a follow-up survey with ETH\/UZH students, where each post has a 1 in 20 chance of being randomly selected. In this follow-up survey, recipients will carefully read your post and share their opinion about both you and your post. They will be informed that the post is drawn from a database of <strong>${e:\/\/Field\/InstagramComp}<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nAlong with your post, we will share that the post is written by a student from ${e:\/\/Field\/UniversityStore} (${e:\/\/Field\/FacultyStore}, ${e:\/\/Field\/GradYearStore}).Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"ReminderAnon2","QuestionID":"QID278"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7POJUFEI0NouVhk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID279","SecondaryAttribute":"You said that you\u2019re willing to pay to have your post removed from the database. What is the maxi.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You said that you\u2019re willing to pay to have your post removed from the database. What is the maximum amount (out of your CHF10 participation payment) you would be willing to pay? <br><br>Please enter a number up to 10.  As explained before, it\u2019s in your best interest to answer truthfully so you get the outcome you want.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You said that you\u2019re willing to pay to have your post removed from the database. What is the maxi...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"LogicType":"Question","QuestionID":"QID276","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID276\/SelectableChoice\/1","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID276","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID276\/SelectableChoice\/1","Type":"Expression","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Which of the following best describes your preference about removing your post from the database?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I\u2019m willing to pay (i.e., give up part of my CHF 10) to ha